The C binding wraps honzo-core into a plain C API using Diplomat. It provides read only access to Honzo files. You can parse, inspect, and read chunks. Building and streaming are not available.
Usage
#include &quot;honzo.h&quot;

HonzoHandle* handle = HonzoHandle_parse(data, data_len, 1);
uint32_t count = HonzoHandle_chunk_count(handle);
// ... use handle ...
HonzoHandle_destroy(handle);




